  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Rock dragon eye refers to the eyes of the ancient desolate beast rock dragon. It is a rank seven immortal material, and among some gathering missions it is harder to obtain than even certain rank eight materials.",
      "chapters": [
        871
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ancient-rock-dragon",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A rock dragon is born when lightning strikes a rockman tribe graveyard thick with buried rockman corpses. Its body is made of rock, like the rockmen themselves, and it once served as a rockman guardian war beast of high defense. Rockman tribes are rare in later eras, so finding a rock dragon is extremely hard; even then, defeating one is another matter. Large amounts of rock dragon eyes can be broken up and fused in a refinement path Gu formation in only a few breaths.",
      "chapters": [
        871
